  "body": "## What fails\n\n`cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --all-targets` (and the debug test build) on upstream/main `2b7a8950d` and later:\n\n```\nerror[E0063]: missing field `basis_version` in initializer of `operation::types::params::Tilt`\n   --> crates/app/src/posting_section_mode.rs:133:35\n```\n\n## Cause\n\nTwo PRs that each built alone, merged in sequence on 2026-11-16 without a combined test:\n- PR #2157 (`81f24951e`) added the required field `Tilt::basis_version`.\n- PR #2245 (`2b7a8950d`) added a unit test in `posting_section_mode.rs` with a `Tilt` literal of the old shape.\n\nTest code only. Product code builds. Found by mkinney's hourly main health check.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd `basis_version: 1` to the literal (the value of every other new `Tilt` literal, for example in `operation/frame.rs` and `tests/area_controls.rs`).\n\nDone means: the all-targets clippy and the `posting_section_mode` unit tests are green on main.\n",
